module.exports = { html: "<div><p style=\"font-size:29.6px;line-height:38.4px;font-weight:700;color:rgb(0, 43, 73);margin:20px 0px 10px 0px;\"><b style=\"font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;\">Hong Kong Code of Conduct for ESG Ratings and Data Products Providers</span></b></p><p style=\"font-size:16.9px;line-height:20.3px;text-align:justify;margin:0px 0px 25.3px 0px;\"><span>Date: 2025-03-26</span></p><p style=\"font-size:16.9px;line-height:20.3px;text-align:justify;margin:0px 0px 25.3px 0px;\"><b style=\"font-weight:400;\"><span>Sponsored by the Hong Kong Securities and Futures Commission</span></b></p><img src=\"https://legaloneglobal.azureedge.net/storelegaloneglobalpub/Hong_Kong_Code_of_Conduct_for_ESG_Ratings_and_Data_Products_Provider.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:10px 0;\"><p style=\"font-size:16.9px;line-height:20.3px;text-align:justify;margin:0px 0px 25.3px 0px;\"></p><p style=\"font-size:16.9px;line-height:24px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(48, 48, 48);margin:0px 0px 16px 0px;\"><b style=\"font-weight:400;\"><span><strong style=\"font-weight:700;\">Introduction</strong></span></b></p><p style=\"font-size:16.9px;line-height:20.3px;margin:0px 0px 25.3px 0px;\"><span>The International Capital Markets Association (ICMA) Hong Kong Code of Conduct for ESG Ratings and Data Products Providers, sponsored by the Hong Kong Securities and Futures Commission (SFC), serves as a foundational framework to ensure the integrity, transparency, and reliability of ESG ratings and data products. Developed in alignment with international best practices, the Code aims to establish robust standards for governance, operational controls, and conflict-of-interest management in the growing field of ESG assessments.</span></p><p style=\"font-size:16.9px;line-height:20.3px;margin:0px 0px 25.3px 0px;\"><span>LegalOne proudly supports the ICMA Hong Kong Code of Conduct as part of our commitment to advancing sustainable finance and promoting responsible corporate practices. By adhering to the principles set forth by the Code, we underscore our dedication to providing high-quality ESG ratings and data products that empower businesses and investors to make informed, impactful decisions.</span></p><p style=\"font-size:16.9px;line-height:24px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(48, 48, 48);margin:0px 0px 16px 0px;\"><b style=\"font-weight:400;\"><span><strong style=\"font-weight:700;\">Background About LegalOne</strong></span></b></p><p style=\"font-size:16.9px;line-height:20.3px;margin:0px 0px 25.3px 0px;\"><span>LegalOne is an independent global rating and research company offering unique insights to senior executives, general counsel, and decision-makers. It specialises in evaluations of commercial deals, dispute cases, and intellectual property matters, supported by client testimonials. LegalOne also publishes high-quality industry reports, news, and articles, presenting expert opinions on emerging trends and challenges. Through its advisory division, LegalOne Intelligence, the company delivers tailored market strategies, expert analyses, and in-depth reports. </span></p><p style=\"font-size:16.9px;line-height:20.3px;margin:0px 0px 25.3px 0px;\"><span>With decades of experience, LegalOne provides critical insights and data to support strategic decision-making for corporate leaders at local, regional, and global levels.</span></p><p style=\"font-size:16.9px;line-height:24px;text-align:justify;color:rgb(48, 48, 48);margin:0px 0px 16px 0px;\"><b style=\"font-weight:400;\"><span><strong style=\"font-weight:700;\">Principles of Self-attestation Document</strong></span></b></p><p style=\"font-size:16.9px;line-height:20.3px;margin:0px 0px 25.3px 0px;\"><span>As part of our application of the ICMA Hong Kong Code of Conduct, LegalOne's Self-attestation Document will detail the following principles in relation to our business operations:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0 12px 34px;padding-left:12px;text-indent:-12px;font-size:16.9px;line-height:20.3px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.9px;\">1.</span> Transparency: LegalOne ensures full disclosure of methodologies, processes, and data sources used in ESG ratings and products. We prioritise clarity and accessibility for all stakeholders.</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0 12px 34px;padding-left:12px;text-indent:-12px;font-size:16.9px;line-height:20.3px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.9px;\">2.</span> Good Governance: Robust governance structures are in place to maintain the integrity of our ESG services, ensuring accountability and ethical practices across all operations.</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0 12px 34px;padding-left:12px;text-indent:-12px;font-size:16.9px;line-height:20.3px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.9px;\">3.</span> Quality Assurance: LegalOne has implemented advanced systems and controls to ensure the accuracy, reliability, and credibility of our ESG assessments and data products.</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0 12px 34px;padding-left:12px;text-indent:-12px;font-size:16.9px;line-height:20.3px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.9px;\">4.</span> Conflict-of-Interest Management: Comprehensive policies are applied to identify, disclose, and mitigate conflicts of interest, reinforcing impartiality in our services.</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0 22.6px 34px;padding-left:12px;text-indent:-12px;font-size:16.9px;line-height:20.3px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.9px;\">5.</span> Global Alignment: While adhering to the ICMA Hong Kong Code of Conduct, LegalOne integrates internationally recognised ESG frameworks to ensure consistency and alignment with global best practices.</p><p style=\"font-size:16.9px;line-height:20.3px;margin:16px 0px 16px 0px;\"><span>This Self-attestation Document published on our platform is a testament to LegalOne's commitment to excellence and adherence to the principles of the ICMA Hong Kong Code of Conduct. Together, we aim to foster trust, accountability, and innovation within the ESG sector.</span></p><p style=\"font-size:16.9px;line-height:20.3px;text-align:justify;margin:5.1px 0px 0.1px 0px;\"><span></span></p><div><table style=\"font-size:14.8px;line-height:17.7px;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed;margin:10px 0 18px;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);width:25.6%;background-color:rgb(14, 92, 141);padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"line-height:15.2px;text-align:center;margin:0;\"><b style=\"font-weight:400;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Code of Conduct Reference</span></b></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);width:37%;background-color:rgb(14, 92, 141);padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"text-align:center;margin:0;\"><b style=\"font-weight:400;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Principles and actions</span></b></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);width:37%;background-color:rgb(14, 92, 141);padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"line-height:15.2px;text-align:center;margin:0;\"><b style=\"font-weight:400;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255, 255, 255);\">How has the principle / action been implemented?</span></b></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(178, 196, 223);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>1. Principle on Good Governance</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>1.1</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>ESG ratings and data products providers should ensure appropriate governance arrangements are in place that enable them to promote and uphold the Principles and overall objectives of the Code of Conduct.</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>See responses 1.4 & 1.5.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(227, 232, 244);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>Actions</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>ESG ratings and data products providers should have appropriate governance arrangements in place that:</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>1.4</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(A)<span style=\"font-size:9.3px;\"></span></span> <span><span>include a clear organisational structure with well-defined, transparent and consistent roles and responsibilities for personnel involved in the determination, publication, or oversight, as appropriate, of an ESG rating or of an ESG data product; and which</span></span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne Global Limited (LegalOne) has suitable governance arrangements in place, including a clear organisational structure with well-defined, transparent, and consistent roles and responsibilities for personnel engaged in the determination, publication, or oversight of ESG Ratings and Data Products.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>1.5</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(B)<span style=\"font-size:9.3px;\"></span></span><span><span>enable them to follow the Principles set out in this Code of Conduct.</span></span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne's governance arrangements are designed to support adherence to the Principles outlined in the Code.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(178, 196, 223);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>2. Principle on Securing Quality (Systems and Controls)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>2.1</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span><span>ESG ratings and data products providers should adopt and implement written policies and procedures designed to help ensure the issuance of high quality ESG ratings and data products.</span></span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>See responses 2.4-2.13.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(227, 232, 244);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>Actions</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>These policies and procedures should be drafted taking into account the nature, scale and complexity of ESG ratings and data products providers' respective businesses and should require that ESG ratings/data products are based on:</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>2.4</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span><span>(A)</span></span><span><span></span></span> <span><span>publicly disclosed data sources, where possible, and other information sources, where necessary;</span></span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne discloses the sources of information used in the development of its ESG Products in a reasonable and transparent manner. It obtains input data for these products from various sources, including publicly disclosed ESG reports, data acquired from third parties, press releases, news articles, government databases, and more. In very limited cases, LegalOne utilises non-public information, which is safeguarded in accordance with the confidentiality provisions outlined in the relevant contracts.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>2.5</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span><span>(B)</span></span><span><span></span></span> the adoption, implementation and provision of transparency around methodologies for their ESG ratings and data products that are defined, rigorous, systematic, applied continuously, in accordance with Principle 4, while maintaining a balance with respect to proprietary or confidential aspects of the methodologies; and</p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne has implemented consistently applied methodologies for numerous ESG Products. The methodology documents are developed and maintained by the teams responsible for supporting the creation of these products.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>2.6</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(C)<span style=\"font-size:9.3px;\"></span></span><span>A thorough analysis of relevant information consistent with the applicable methodologies available to the ESG ratings and data products providers at the time of determination.</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne has established formal procedures and accompanying documentation to deliver ESG Ratings and Data Products, ensuring they are based on a comprehensive analysis of relevant information as specified in each applicable methodology.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>Furthermore, having regard to the nature, scale and complexity of their respective businesses, ESG ratings and data products providers should also ensure:</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>2.8</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(A)<span style=\"font-size:9.3px;\"></span></span><span>they monitor on an ongoing basis and regularly update, as appropriate, their ESG ratings and data products, except where specifically disclosed that the rating is a point in time rating;</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne monitors and updates its ESG Ratings and Data Products as indicated in each relevant applicable methodology.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>2.9</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(B)<span style=\"font-size:9.3px;\"></span></span><span>they regularly review the relevant methodologies and sufficiently communicate changes made to the methodologies as well as potential impacts of these changes to the ESG ratings and data products;</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne conducts regular reviews of its methodologies and ensures that any changes, along with their potential impacts on ESG Ratings and Data Products, are communicated clearly and effectively.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>2.10</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(C)<span style=\"font-size:9.3px;\"></span></span><span>they maintain internal records to support their ESG ratings and data products;</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne maintains internal records to support its ESG Ratings and Data Products.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>2.11</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(D)</span> <span>they have sufficient resources (personnel and technological capabilities) to consistently apply the relevant methodologies to determine high quality ESG ratings and data products, to seek out information they need in order to make an assessment, analyse all the information relevant to their decision-making processes, and conduct quality control on their processes and production of ESG ratings and data products. </span></p><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>The quality controls should include both: </span></p><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(i)</span> <span>procedural checks to ensure that the methodology and internal processes are followed correctly; and </span></p><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(ii)</span> <span>holistic checks to ensure that the process considering the plausibility, coherence and logic of the product is sound. The quality control framework should also allow for the appropriate and timely consideration of information brought to ESG ratings and data products providers' attention by covered entities or users, as outlined at action 6.10 below; and</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne ensures the availability of professional resources and technologies it considers essential for the development and delivery of its ESG Products.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>2.12</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(E)</span> <span>the personnel involved in the determination, publication or oversight, as appropriate, of ESG ratings and data products are professional, competent, and of high integrity.</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne takes appropriate measures to evaluate its personnel and ensure they possess the necessary skills to fulfil their responsibilities. Staff involved in collecting and analysing ESG data are equipped with the professional expertise required to perform their duties with integrity.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>2.13</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>ESG ratings and data products providers could consider providing ESG ratings and data products to clients in a machine-readable format.</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne delivers its ESG Ratings and Data Products to clients in a machine-readable format and remains committed to staying aligned with market needs.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(178, 196, 223);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>3. Principle on Conflicts of Interest</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>3.1</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>ESG ratings and data products providers should adopt and implement written policies and procedures designed to help ensure their decisions are independent, free from political or economic interference, and appropriately address actual or potential Conflicts of Interest that may arise from, among other things, the ESG ratings and data products providers' organisational structure, business or financial activities, or the financial interests of the ESG ratings and data products providers and their officers and employees.</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne upholds a strict separation from product issuers to ensure that no beneficial relationships compromise the integrity of our assessments. We have implemented comprehensive written policies and procedures to safeguard our decisions from political or economic influence. These policies address actual and potential Conflicts of Interest arising from our organisational structure, business activities, or the financial interests of our personnel. Additionally, we regularly train our employees to highlight the importance of maintaining independence and integrity throughout our evaluation process.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>3.2</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>ESG ratings and data products providers should identify, avoid or appropriately manage, mitigate and disclose actual or potential Conflicts of Interest that may compromise the independence and integrity of the ESG ratings and data products providers' operations.</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne has implemented, and continues to implement, appropriate measures to manage and mitigate the risk of potential Conflicts of Interest associated with its ESG products.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(227, 232, 244);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>Actions</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>ESG ratings and data products providers should:</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>3.5</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span><span>(A)</span></span> <span> adopt written internal policies and procedures and mechanisms designed to (1) identify, and (2) eliminate, or manage, mitigate and disclose, as appropriate, any actual or potential Conflicts of Interest related to their ESG ratings or data products that may influence the opinions and analyses ESG ratings and data products providers make or the judgment and analyses of the individuals they employ who have an influence on their ESG ratings or data products decisions; and</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne continues to take proactive measures to manage and minimise the risk of potential Conflicts of Interest associated with its ESG products.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>3.6</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span><span>(B)</span></span> <span>disclose such conflict avoidance and management measures.</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne will provide a Conflict of Interest Statement upon request.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>ESG ratings and data products providers should take steps to help ensure that any existing or potential business relationship between them (or their affiliates) and any entity or any other party for which they provide ESG ratings or data products would not affect the integrity of the ESG ratings and data products being offered to those entities or other parties. These steps could include (but are not limited to) the following measures in respect of appropriate staff:</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>3.8</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span><span>(A)</span></span> <span>putting in place measures to help ensure such staff refrain from any securities or derivatives trading presenting inherent Conflicts of Interest with the ESG ratings and data products;</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne has implemented, and continues to implement, measures it deems appropriate to prevent relevant employees from engaging in securities or derivatives transactions that may give rise to Conflicts of Interest related to its ESG products.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>3.9</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span><span>(B)</span></span> <span>structuring reporting lines for such staff and their compensation arrangements to eliminate or appropriately manage actual and potential Conflicts of Interest related to their ESG ratings and data products;</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne has established appropriate reporting lines and compensation structures to prevent Conflicts of Interest and effectively manage and mitigate the risks of potential conflicts.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>3.10</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span><span>(C)</span></span> <span>not compensating or evaluating such staff on the basis of the amount of revenue that an ESG rating and data products provider derives from an entity for which such staff provides ESG ratings and data products, or with which such staff regularly interact regarding such ESG ratings and data products; and</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne has developed a framework for evaluating staff performance that avoids linking compensation to revenue from any specific entity. Instead, the evaluation process focuses on qualitative metrics, including adherence to established methodologies, the quality of analyses, and contributions to upholding the integrity of ESG assessments. Employees are not compensated or evaluated on the basis of the amount of revenue that the employee has contributed to the ESG rating and data products.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>3.11</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span><span>(D)</span></span> <span>where consistent with confidentiality, contractual and other business, legal and regulatory requirements, disclosing in respect of such staff the general nature of the compensation arrangement or any other business or financial relationships that exist with an entity for which the ESG ratings and data products provider provides ESG ratings or data products.</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne provides disclosures regarding potential Conflicts of Interest within its ESG Ratings and Data Products reports, whenever applicable.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span></span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(E) Other steps taken, if any:</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>None</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(178, 196, 223);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>4. Principle on Transparency</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>4.1</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>ESG ratings and data products providers should make adequate levels of public disclosure and transparency a priority for their ESG ratings and data products, including their methodologies and processes to enable the users of the product to understand what the product is and how it is produced, including any potential Conflicts of Interest and while maintaining a balance with respect to proprietary or confidential information, data and methodologies.</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne acknowledges that transparency is a top priority and a critical component of its operations. LegalOne is dedicated to maintaining the quality of its ESG products by employing well-defined, quantitative, and data-driven methodologies</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(227, 232, 244);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>Actions</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>ESG ratings and data products providers should, where applicable:</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>4.4</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(A)</span> <span>make public disclosure and transparency a priority for their ESG ratings and data products offerings, subject to commercial sensitivity considerations;</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>Recognising the critical importance of transparency, LegalOne ensures that its ESG Ratings and Data Products methodologies, along with related methodology processes, are publicly accessible on its website.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>4.5</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(B)</span> <span>clearly describe their ESG ratings and data products to enable the users to understand the ESG rating's or ESG data product's intended purpose including its measurement objective; and</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne offers detailed explanations of its rating methodologies and the data sources it employs. This ensures that users understand the rigor of the assessments and are well-informed about the foundation of its ratings.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>4.6</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(C)</span> <span>publish sufficient information about the methodologies underlying their ESG ratings and data products and how they ensure their consistent implementation to enable the users of these products to understand how their outputs were determined.</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne has established internal controls and regular review processes to ensure consistent application of its methodologies across all ratings. These processes include periodic reviews and updates to reflect changes in industry standards or regulatory requirements. Additionally, we provide guidance materials and resources to help users interpret our ratings and understand the implications of the methodologies employed. By encouraging user feedback, we continuously refine our methodologies and enhance clarity, ensuring that our outputs align with user needs and expectations.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>4.7 - 4.16</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>ESG ratings and data products providers should, where applicable, publish information that is relevant to understanding their methodologies, subject to any proprietary or confidentiality considerations. This information may include, but is not limited to:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(A)</span> <span>the measurement objective of the ESG rating; </span></p><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(B)</span> <span>the criteria used to assess the entity or company; </span></p><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(C)</span> <span>the KPIs used to assess the entity against each criterion; </span></p><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(D)</span> <span>the relative weighting of these criteria to that assessment;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(E)</span> <span>the scope of business activities and group entities included in the assessment; </span></p><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(F)</span> <span>the principal sources of qualitative and quantitative information used in the assessment, including for example whether the information is forward- looking (such as transition plans), the use of industry averages, estimations or other methodologies when actual data is not available, as well as information on how the absence of information was treated;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(G)</span> <span>the time horizon of the assessment;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(H)</span> <span>the meaning of each assessment category; and</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(I)</span> <span>a regular evaluation of their methodologies against the outputs which they have been used to produce.</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne places a strong emphasis on transparency regarding the data and methodologies used to develop its ESG products. As part of its commitment to continuous improvement, LegalOne is actively reviewing its approach and refining its methodologies to align with its ongoing efforts to adopt the Code of Conduct.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(178, 196, 223);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>5. Principle on Confidentiality (Systems and Controls)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>5.1</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>ESG ratings and data products providers should adopt and implement written policies and procedures designed to address and protect all non-public information received from or communicated to them by any entity, or its agents, related to their ESG ratings and data products, in a manner appropriate in the circumstances.</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne is dedicated to maintaining the highest standards of confidentiality with respect to non-public information associated with its ESG ratings. To this end, LegalOne has established and implemented comprehensive written policies and procedures to safeguard such information and ensure it is not redistributed without proper authorisation from ESG data providers.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(227, 232, 244);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>Actions</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>ESG ratings and data products providers should:</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>5.4</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(A)</span> <span>adopt and implement written policies and procedures and mechanisms related to their ESG ratings and data products designed to address and protect the non-public nature of information shared with them by entities under the terms of a confidentiality agreement or otherwise under a mutual understanding that the information is shared confidentially;</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne has implemented stringent confidentiality policies that define clear protocols for the handling, storage, and communication of non-public information. These policies ensure that such data remains accessible solely to authorised personnel or teams.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>5.5</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(B)</span> <span>adopt and implement written policies and procedures designed to address the use of non-public information only for purposes related to their ESG ratings and data products or otherwise in accordance with their confidentiality arrangements with the entity; and</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne has implemented data handling procedures that incorporate secure methods for both data transmission and storage. These measures are designed to safeguard information against unauthorised access and potential breaches.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>5.6</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(C)</span> <span>include information on data confidentiality management and on the protection of non-public information to the extent terms of engagement are published.</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne conducts routine evaluations of its data management practices to ensure compliance with confidentiality policies and to actively identify opportunities for improvement.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(178, 196, 223);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>6. Principle on Engagement (Systems and Controls)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>6.1</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>ESG ratings and data products providers should regularly consider whether their information gathering processes with entities covered by their products leads to efficient information procurement for both the providers and these entities. Where potential improvements to information gathering processes are identified, ESG ratings and data products providers should consider what measures can be taken to implement them.</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne utilises a web-based login gateway to optimise data collection for its ESG assessments, improving both the efficiency and accuracy of the information gathered. Additionally, data is sourced directly from product issuers to ensure relevance and timeliness. When opportunities for enhancing information-gathering processes are identified, LegalOne actively evaluates and implements improvements, maintaining an approach that is both efficient and advantageous for all stakeholders.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>6.2</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>Where feasible and appropriate, ESG ratings and data products providers should respond to and address issues flagged by entities covered by their ESG ratings and data products and by users while maintaining the independence and integrity of these products.</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne prioritises the integrity and objectivity of its assessments. ESG ratings are grounded in factual data to ensure that evaluations remain unbiased and reliable for investors. While feedback and issues raised by entities and users of ESG ratings are welcomed, inputs are carefully reviewed to ensure alignment with rigorous methodologies. When appropriate and feasible, concerns are considered; however, any adjustments or responses are made without compromising independence. LegalOne is committed to maintaining a transparent and consistent process that upholds the integrity of ratings, ensuring that the information provided is a trustworthy resource for all stakeholders.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(227, 232, 244);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>Actions</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>Where they collect information from covered entities on a bilateral basis, ESG ratings and data products providers should:</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>6.5</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(A)</span> <span>communicate sufficiently in advance by when they expect to request this information regarding their ESG ratings and data products; and</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne does not currently collect information via surveys to develop its ESG products. However, certain ESG products may incorporate data obtained through surveys conducted by third-party data providers. LegalOne does not verify the compliance status of its third-party data providers with the requirements outlined in the Code of Conduct.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>6.6</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(B)</span> <span>include in their requests, pre-inputted information either from publicly available sources or from the covered entities previous submissions, where possible, for the covered entities' review or confirmation.</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>See response 6.5.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>ESG ratings and data products providers should:</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>6.8</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(A)</span> <span>provide a clear and consistent contact point with whom the covered entity can interact to address any queries relating to the assessment provided by the ESG ratings and data products provider;</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\">The email address <a href=\"mailto:research@legaloneglobal.com\" style=\"color:rgb(0, 132, 186);text-decoration:none;word-break:break-all;\">research@legaloneglobal.com</a> serves as the designated point of contact for all covered entities. Through this channel, covered entities can submit queries regarding the assessments provided.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>6.9</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(B)</span> <span>where feasible and appropriate, inform covered entities:</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(i)</span> <span>that they are in the process of being assessed; and</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(ii)</span> <span>of the principal categories of data on which an ESG rating is based before the publication of the ESG rating;</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>LegalOne generally adheres to the following practices when engaging with covered entities, while allowing for additional steps or necessary adjustments as needed: </span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0 11.8px 11px;padding-left:12px;text-indent:-12px;font-size:14.8px;line-height:17.7px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.8px;\">•</span> Covered entities are notified and encouraged to provide feedback on published ESG Products, promoting accuracy and transparency.</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0 11.8px 11px;padding-left:12px;text-indent:-12px;font-size:14.8px;line-height:17.7px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.8px;\">•</span> LegalOne regularly reviews and refines its methodologies.</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0 11.8px 11px;padding-left:12px;text-indent:-12px;font-size:14.8px;line-height:17.7px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.8px;\">•</span> Transparent assessments are achieved through the application of quantitative, rules-based, and data-driven methodologies.</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0 11.8px 11px;padding-left:12px;text-indent:-12px;font-size:14.8px;line-height:17.7px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.8px;\">•</span> Comprehensive policies and procedures are in place to safeguard non-public information used in the development of ESG Products.</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0 11.8px 11px;padding-left:12px;text-indent:-12px;font-size:14.8px;line-height:17.7px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.8px;\">•</span> LegalOne upholds high standards of conduct and expects covered entites to refrain from providing price-sensitive or insider information, or offering monetary or non-monetary benefits, such as gifts or entertainment, to product specialists or employees.</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0 26.6px 11px;padding-left:12px;text-indent:-12px;font-size:14.8px;line-height:17.7px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14.8px;\">•</span> Further details about LegalOne's principles of engagement with covered entities, along with contact information, can be found on its website.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>6.10</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(C)</span> <span>allow the covered entity and users to draw attention to any factual errors or omissions in the ESG rating or ESG data product, including the data and information underlying the ESG rating or ESG data product; and</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>See response 6.9.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>6.11</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);background-color:rgb(246, 248, 252);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>(D)</span> <span>publish terms of engagement describing how ESG ratings and data products providers will typically engage with their covered entities, including when information is likely to be requested and the opportunities available (if any) to the covered entity for review.</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1.3px solid rgb(7, 92, 141);padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;vertical-align:middle;\"><p style=\"margin:0;\"><span>See response 6.9.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"font-size:16.9px;line-height:20.3px;text-align:justify;margin:5.5px 0px 0.1px 0px;\"><span></span></p></div>" };
